     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Triple Threat puts climbing, sliding, swinging and hopping into one robot-themed play station. Two robot-head towers are joined by a bridge, slides come down from the decks and a swing set is attached at one end. Key users are 5 to 12 years and the age group is 5+, which makes it a good match for a primary school or a society with plenty of school-going children. Choose from Play Orange and Royal Turquoise, Play Red and Knight Blue, or Crazy Pink and Baby Blue. The website lists a product area of 23'7\" x 18'6\" and a capacity of 15. On Triple Threat, galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope carry our 3-year warranty. Ask us for a layout drawing with the swing zone marked."
     }
    ]
